  "body": "Phase 3 G2 修复复核候选。原固定5a5e093c2e9b39abe1332e49d1df40d20f9fd33f由GPT Work判 **REQUEST CHANGES（1 High / 2 Medium）**；三项已由开发方修复并自测，**仍待主审确认CLOSED**。G1 PLAN PASS及U-001/U-002设计确认不变。\n\nAQRP_FIXED_REVIEW_SHA: 9ac5db069287a6e4a095e25ae8c3cc8fa229cded\n\n### 复核入口与原始审查\n- [本轮固定版本复核指令](https://github.com/wwooyy429/Alpha-Quant-Research-Platform-AQRP-/blob/9ac5db069287a6e4a095e25ae8c3cc8fa229cded/docs/audits/phase-3/g2-5a5e093/RECHECK_INSTRUCTIONS.md)\n- [原主审报告，原字节](https://github.com/wwooyy429/Alpha-Quant-Research-Platform-AQRP-/blob/9ac5db069287a6e4a095e25ae8c3cc8fa229cded/docs/audits/phase-3/g2-5a5e093/received/GPT-Work-Phase3-G2-5a5e093-Review.md) · [原修复任务](https://github.com/wwooyy429/Alpha-Quant-Research-Platform-AQRP-/blob/9ac5db069287a6e4a095e25ae8c3cc8fa229cded/docs/audits/phase-3/g2-5a5e093/received/Codex-Phase3-G2-5a5e093-Fix-Tasks.md)\n- [封存接收与完整/子集清单](https://github.com/wwooyy429/Alpha-Quant-Research-Platform-AQRP-/blob/9ac5db069287a6e4a095e25ae8c3cc8fa229cded/docs/audits/phase-3/g2-5a5e093/RECEIPT.json) · [开发方处理意见](https://github.com/wwooyy429/Alpha-Quant-Research-Platform-AQRP-/blob/9ac5db069287a6e4a095e25ae8c3cc8fa229cded/docs/audits/phase-3/g2-5a5e093/DEVELOPER_RESPONSE.md)\n- [新验证回执](https://github.com/wwooyy429/Alpha-Quant-Research-Platform-AQRP-/blob/9ac5db069287a6e4a095e25ae8c3cc8fa229cded/docs/audits/phase-3/g2-5a5e093/validation-1b4be23/VALIDATION.json) · [SDK存储子集](https://github.com/wwooyy429/Alpha-Quant-Research-Platform-AQRP-/blob/9ac5db069287a6e4a095e25ae8c3cc8fa229cded/docs/audits/phase-3/g2-5a5e093/validation-1b4be23/REPOSITORY_SDK_SUBSET.json)\n- [新环境/源码身份](https://github.com/wwooyy429/Alpha-Quant-Research-Platform-AQRP-/blob/9ac5db069287a6e4a095e25ae8c3cc8fa229cded/docs/audits/phase-3/IMPLEMENTATION_IDENTITY.json) · [26项追踪](https://github.com/wwooyy429/Alpha-Quant-Research-Platform-AQRP-/blob/9ac5db069287a6e4a095e25ae8c3cc8fa229cded/docs/audits/phase-3/IMPLEMENTATION_TRACEABILITY.md) · [全资料哈希清单](https://github.com/wwooyy429/Alpha-Quant-Research-Platform-AQRP-/blob/9ac5db069287a6e4a095e25ae8c3cc8fa229cded/docs/audits/phase-3/FILE_MANIFEST.json)\n\n主审封存ZIP：296718793 bytes，SHA-256 `54f559f9360cafcdc4d4fc9ab7af7a3eb6c13af846b6ab19524208e2cf336ca0`。319项成员、大小、哈希、精确集合及CRC均核验通过。仓库保存147份原文件及原manifest/外置Seal；其余172项（SDK、三份ZIP、原扫描对抗输入及重复结果渲染）原字节完整留在用户原封存包，逐项列明，未改审查原文或增加扫描例外。\n\n### 三项修复\n| 原发现 | 实际处理 | 状态 |\n|---|---|---|\n| WORK-P3-IMPL-001 High | 选中security_master加入标签依赖、可用时间/信息区间/hash和修订血缘；晚到上市/退市更正不能提前入fit | Developer fixed; GPT Work recheck required |\n| WORK-P3-IMPL-002 Medium | 审批必须来自终态manifest唯一approvals条目，并核验、解析同次读取的原字节；后补/替换/非映射/不匹配拒绝 | Developer fixed; GPT Work recheck required |\n| WORK-P3-IMPL-003 Medium | 公共pipeline/compose两时钟必填、UTC规范化、session共同cutoff、拒绝未来可用/重复键，输出输入hash和时钟血缘 | Developer fixed; GPT Work recheck required |\n\n新因果探针：[原始结果](https://github.com/wwooyy429/Alpha-Quant-Research-Platform-AQRP-/blob/9ac5db069287a6e4a095e25ae8c3cc8fa229cded/docs/audits/phase-3/g2-5a5e093/validation-1b4be23/extras/after-causal/AFTER_CAUSAL_PROBE.json)。收益0.1，label_available_at=2024-01-05T00:00:00Z；Jan4 fit train_count=0、LABEL_NOT_AVAILABLE_AT_FIT。正常同刻/共同交集重新z/方向、审批正向路径、原17组答案和旧三Ref保留。\n\n### 实际开发方验证\n业务执行提交：`1b4be236e888805f5c4e45357b158fcdb6058df0`。最终提交仅证据/状态变化，src/tests/tools/workflow/构建/锁/扫描配置逐字节相同。\n- 干净Git归档、安装真实wheel、CPython3.13.16、完整SDK：**578 passed / 0 failed / 0 errors / 0 skipped**，覆盖率门槛通过，研究链/替换/原wheel+锁/原66文件及3原运行重放、Golden参考和秘密扫描完成。\n- 新安装wheel上，未编辑原16＋4：**20 passed**；未编辑主审原四：**4 passed**；原91数学：**91 passed**；三项扫描对抗控制：**3 passed**。91脚本内旧SHA/执行者是原脚本硬编码标签，实际新执行为Codex开发方，已单独记录，不能算新GPT Work独立执行。\n- 原四产品失败、首次新增夹具hash差异、直接源码573 passed / 5旧环境setup errors均保留。最终SDK自行配置原环境后578通过；未删除失败或改正确金融expected。\n- [业务提交CI run39725429442](https://github.com/wwooyy429/Alpha-Quant-Research-Platform-AQRP-/actions/runs/39725429442)：**Windows/Ubuntu各578通过**；两份官方原ZIP实际下载，SHA-256/大小/CRC/精确清单/45模块wheel/环境/工件和重放核验通过。\n  - Windows [artifact12402413063](https://github.com/wwooyy429/Alpha-Quant-Research-Platform-AQRP-/actions/runs/39725429442/artifacts/12402413063)：95545637 bytes；SHA-256 `6d34e2f1f8092d77de228530fb2b3c485ae63cc43ca9dac9ff7eaaaac8b78182`。\n  - Ubuntu [artifact12403385762](https://github.com/wwooyy429/Alpha-Quant-Research-Platform-AQRP-/actions/runs/39725429442/artifacts/12403385762)：136818171 bytes；SHA-256 `09893960a759092c23e8cf56162e12f02c68e25240723191e24d7dba3240fec4`。\n  - CI执行PR integration `050d9dfa08a1b9c0bfc372555e0c328b2aeec6bf`，整个tree核验等于业务提交；它不是main合并。\n- 新SDK原185份选择文件全部验证；仓库明确存26份根日志/环境/JUnit/coverage/wheel/重放概要，159份原数据/ledger/信号/阶段/报告及原依赖wheel仍在完整本地SDK与官方原ZIP，未把Git子集称完整SDK。\n- 最终固定提交 [CI run39726898890](https://github.com/wwooyy429/Alpha-Quant-Research-Platform-AQRP-/actions/runs/39726898890)：**Windows/Ubuntu均SUCCESS，各578 passed / 0 failed / 0 errors / 0 skipped**。官方原ZIP已实际下载并核验SHA-256、大小、CRC、完整选择成员、45模块wheel/receipt、覆盖率、环境、快照/ledger/95批engine（含缓存引用）及原66文件/3原运行重放证据。\n  - Windows [artifact12404165070](https://github.com/wwooyy429/Alpha-Quant-Research-Platform-AQRP-/actions/runs/39726898890/artifacts/12404165070)：95545850 bytes；SHA-256 `f26ba7566ad44a3c3e415fca5dbcaf46574b2ff8325eaf86c52c86e4d5b6b456`；185 selected、186实际ZIP成员（含selection自身）；wheel SHA-256 `dbb836053efadf76c897d6c6ac847326466f4d0ef97c8e1b0b54994ed853a276`。\n  - Ubuntu [artifact12403373418](https://github.com/wwooyy429/Alpha-Quant-Research-Platform-AQRP-/actions/runs/39726898890/artifacts/12403373418)：136817989 bytes；SHA-256 `3b7c4534a48d4f10a94228077af6e7acac7ea6671faf3230e2acc09739728589`；184 selected、185实际ZIP成员；wheel SHA-256 `0a0491008550c695b78fdf54f179ace693c10a08e66d1b44004a800b5d36be9a`。\n  - 实际执行PR integration commit `d3d9b262d4866e8768670dc1d2392ef32bbd7889`，整个tree `2d2790365e5f202796d5089c93abbb1c037093fa`已取回并核实等于固定审查9ac5db069287a6e4a095e25ae8c3cc8fa229cded；不是main合并。\n  - 两份原ZIP含实际environment/commands/JUnit/coverage/wheel、完整研究输入/输出/配置/标签/ledger及upload-selection。官方到期2026-11-21；精确原件及校验JSON另存 `C:\\Users\\11638\\AppData\\Local\\AQRP\\runs\\p3-g2-repair-20261022\\actions-original\\9ac5db0-{windows,ubuntu}-original.zip` 及对应 `-verification.json`。\n  - 最终开发方收据：`C:\\Users\\11638\\AppData\\Local\\AQRP\\runs\\p3-g2-repair-20261022\\FINAL_REVIEW_RECEIPT.json`；SHA-256 `182fcd917fe87a80caa775bfe73a34622c3412d0d0e9ff3498a2734b5b3aa2a9`。最终运行信息在此PR固定SHA回执登记，避免制造文件自包含其自身Git SHA；工作区干净，557份仓库审计清单成员/哈希通过。\n\n新45模块bundle SHA-256：`3cec8a9da49a49a93010d7fa6a2012dded25185e2cdca49144cf4d719d56876e`。requirements.lock SHA-256仍为`86c7bf65c9a9690036006360062c8cd10a91279705b4070af7033d7699abffeb`；1957冻结文件、原0.2资产/精确Ref、已归档旧0.3 wheel与原扫描配置均保持。工程receipt仅TEST_ONLY/ENGINEERING_APPROVED/NONE。\n\n### 未闭环与权限\nGPT Work新固定SHA复核及三项关闭；真实四主体部署/权限/私有Test正负控制；实际过程证明、正式统计协议/金融标准、真正独立Test与金融批准；完整历史安装器/宿主字节限制；用户Phase3验收。\n本轮**未部署，未变更账户/ACL/服务/调度，未合并、未打标签、未进入P4**。main仍为f26255fc40a3080bfa883ad64938f60036a14759，稳定标签不动。",
